{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"rejectionReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"RejectionReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker checks each event’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"constraintViolation()"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything else, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rejected event is never enriched, held by a consent, written to a store or delivered. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record a store recovered is checked too, and one rejected is forgotten by the store. In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"debug builds each rejection is also logged at error level."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a rejection joins the waiting report of the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, property and keyword, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reports waiting unread are at most one per constraint the app declares, however many events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"break them. Copies of a tracker s